            "review_text": "Wolf_Pack_SGN\nPerth, Australia2011 contributions\n1\nI understand intellectual property, but not allowing photos in this day and age is ridiculous!\nDec 2016\nI get that people get protective about their product and not wanting people to replicate, but I entered this Tous Les Jours wanting to take a picture of the menu to send to my daughter to tell me what drink she wanted me to get take away for her and was told that I was not allowed to take the photo. Even after explaining this, I was still told that I wasn't allowed to take the photo to send to my daughter to select a drink. \n\nSo I left and didn't purchase anything nor will I return to this store or brand ever again. \n\nLet's get real. It's a smoothie menu. Something the Vietnamese do exceptionally well and fear of replication is ridiculous. Plus we live in a social media society where I usually like to see what's on their menu online before I decide whether I want to visit the location. Let's not forget that Tous Les Jour probably has a website with key promotional blended coffee and drinks all over their website. \n\nDefinitely will never return to this or any other Jous Les Jours store in Vietnam or any other country.\nRead more\nWritten December 17, 2016",
