            "review_text": "PeterTadvisor\nGunnison, Colorado1177 contributions\n0\nWe are avid runners so we can eat bread! Yum!!!\nMar 2016 • Family\nWe have a TOUS Les JOURS Café located on the group floor of our apartment building, THE MANOR. It is a great place to have a quick bread or pastry fix and a cappuccino. We have even had our 20 person QC (Quality Control Team) gather here for a early morning meeting. Our Vietnamese staff is always telling us that they don’t like sweets, but they make an exception and go crazy during these meetings. These places are located all around the city and they are immaculately clear, the staff is friendly and they are all loaded with walled windows so you feel like your in France. A great people watch place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 20, 2016",
